rooms_desc ({"This is the enterance to Bruenor's domain.  A lit lanthorn is hung fromthe 10 ft sloping roof.  The friendly aura about makes you feel at home.The door to the east leads to Bruenor's private chambers.  You smile as youyeah...er hear the sounds of Pearl Jam eminating from the east.","This room is warmed by the hearth on the southern wall. The lagre waterbedin the north-west corner takes up a good portion of the room.  There isa desk in the south-eastern corner of the room, and that is whereall business is done.  There is a framed picture of Bruenor's beloved on theeastern wall.","this is a wide and well lit hallway.There are varoius pictures on the walls of Bruenor destroying simple creature.  There is one you notice of him killing an ant with menace.","This is a balcony over looking the Holy Mission.  Down belowyou see low level characters scurrying about their business.  You seesmall water bollons in a near by bucket, prolly used to drop on the pooroplayers below.","This hallway is filled with captured portraits of your favorate mage, Bruenor, menacing other players.  You notice on picture of him boping soozieon the head demonically.","This room is filled with pictures of Bruenoor killing more fierce creaturessuch as nuns and bears.  There is one painting of bruenor killing locustsby the swarm.s","This is Bruenor's meeting room.  If bruenor is not around, or he is inhis private chambers, he will meet with you here.  There are several couchersfor you to sit on, and some cnacke...er snacks to keep you happy till he arives.","This is the torture chamber.  You see severl desks scattered aboutwith manackles attached to them.  On the desks you see Bruenors home work for this week.","This is a balcony over looking the intire Holy Mission.","There are some other paintings in this room.  Most of them are scrapped due to their bad taste, but one seems to satand out.  As you look at the Painting you realize it is of Bruenor killing Calvyn.  As you try to contain your laughter, you recover the painting with thesheet hanging above it.",})
